---
kind: Command
version: v1
definition:
  name: insert_user
  outputType: String!
  arguments:
    - name: auth_token
      type: String!
      description: "- The auth token of the user in Resy"
    - name: email
      type: String!
      description: "- The email of the user"
    - name: payment_id
      type: String!
      description: >-
        - The payment ID of the user in Resy


        The function will return a JWT that can be used to authenticate the user in the app.
  source:
    dataConnectorName: user_logic
    dataConnectorCommand:
      procedure: insertUser
  graphql:
    rootFieldName: insert_user
    rootFieldKind: Mutation
  description: >-
    This is a convenience function that — absent of a built-out UI — inserts a
    user into the database.

    The following fields are required:

---
kind: CommandPermissions
version: v1
definition:
  commandName: insert_user
  permissions:
    - role: admin
      allowExecution: true

